691 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 117 0 R
/E (Below the median on revenue \(8.8x vs 15.3x\) and above it on premium \(42.3% vs 16.5%\). The revenue discount reflects a de-rated software sector \(Jefferies: a "decade low valuation"\) and PTC's 40% EBITA margin, which turns 8.8x revenue into 21x EBITA.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [60]
>>
endobj
692 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 117 0 R
/E (The premium is high because the undisturbed price was depressed: the offer is about PTC's Oct 2025 high. The 4% premiums for Altair and AspenTech are to last close, after market leaks or an existing majority holder \(Emerson owned about 58%\), so they understate the true premium paid.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [61]
>>
endobj
