/E (We see no need for divestments, because PTC's design and lifecycle tools overlap little with Schneider's AVEVA operations software. PTC's sale of ThingWorx and Kepware to TPG, completed in March 2026, in our view further reduces the industrial IoT overlap. Schneider also agreed to buy Cognite in June 2026, so reviewers see two software deals from the same buyer in close succession.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [41]
>>
